    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cave Heroes</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/501da87c5a52592d02a4fbb53b304bdf.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Cave Heroes is a challenging idle game where you explore dungeons, fight demons and face powerfull bosses. Descending into the depths of the caves, you will find forgotten knowledge, learn to use Dark Mana, collect powerful loot and absorb the power of the Archdemons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve You Village</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/6a080e2b93dd0dcce948e9dd8a87dee8.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Unlock new buildings, hire workers, veterans and archmages and watch your heroes' stats grow. Perform Dark Rituals, idle to accumulate resources, build more buildings and watch as previously invincible enemies are defeated in one blow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Loot</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/ceee3423d5d3f074159ad155f290f2bf.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Fight in quests to collect artifacts, capture Dark Equipment from bosses, complete tasks to achieve Rewards to improve your heroes further.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame Pets and Unlock Skins</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/5e505d650304e123bb5e9a71db7c5986.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Play mini games to rescue pets, tame them to get help on your journey. Unlock 20+ powerful and cute skins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat Dark Lord</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/1f014eabfdfb0b2fc4227f6969dee6ff.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Reach the Dark Fortress and defeat the Dark Lord, ending his ruthless raids forever.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cave Heroes</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/501da87c5a52592d02a4fbb53b304bdf.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Cave Heroes is a challenging idle game where you explore dungeons, fight demons and face powerfull bosses. Descending into the depths of the caves, you will find forgotten knowledge, learn to use Dark Mana, collect powerful loot and absorb the power of the Archdemons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve You Village</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/6a080e2b93dd0dcce948e9dd8a87dee8.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Unlock new buildings, hire workers, veterans and archmages and watch your heroes' stats grow. Perform Dark Rituals, idle to accumulate resources, build more buildings and watch as previously invincible enemies are defeated in one blow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Loot</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/ceee3423d5d3f074159ad155f290f2bf.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Fight in quests to collect artifacts, capture Dark Equipment from bosses, complete tasks to achieve Rewards to improve your heroes further.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame Pets and Unlock Skins</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/5e505d650304e123bb5e9a71db7c5986.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Play mini games to rescue pets, tame them to get help on your journey. Unlock 20+ powerful and cute skins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat Dark Lord</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631210/extras/1f014eabfdfb0b2fc4227f6969dee6ff.avif?t=1726101321\" width=616 height=290 /></span><br>Reach the Dark Fortress and defeat the Dark Lord, ending his ruthless raids forever.",
    "short_description": "Lead a party of Cave Heroes to explore dungeons, battle monsters and defeat tough archdemons. Build your village, collect loot, rescue pets and much more in this idle RPG.",
